+/*
+ * The Web Account Manager: apps ask it for an account provider (a Microsoft
+ * account, a work or school account ...) and then for tokens from that
+ * provider. The providers are plug-ins of the system; none is installed
+ * here, so every provider lookup completes with no provider -- exactly what
+ * Windows answers for a provider it does not have -- and apps take their
+ * own way to sign in (their web sign-in page).
+ */
